write('/about','About DLR · Honest Service. Fair Prices.','Meet Menifee-based DLR Plumbing Solutions Inc. California C-36 plumbing contractor #1162406, offering 24-hour service and community discounts.',inner('ABOUT DLR','Straightforward service.\nSolid workmanship.','DLR Plumbing Solutions Inc. is a Menifee-based plumbing company serving Southern California. Our approach starts with a simple standard: Honest Service. Fair Prices.','home')+section('OUR APPROACH','Know the problem.<br>Understand the work.','<div class="three-columns"><article><span class="step-number">01</span><h3>Listen first</h3><p>Share what changed, what you have noticed, and what you need from the visit. A clear description helps start the investigation.</p></article><article><span class="step-number">02</span><h3>Explain the options</h3><p>A repair, replacement, or investigation should come with an explanation of the findings and scope.</p></article><article><span class="step-number">03</span><h3>Agree on the next step</h3><p>Discuss access, equipment, timing, and work before moving forward. Communication matters at every stage.</p></article></div>')+section('PROFESSIONAL FOUNDATION','California licensed. Menifee based.','<p>DLR holds California contractor license #1162406, classification C-36 Plumbing. The official CSLB record identifies the business in Menifee.</p><a class="text-link" href="'+license+'" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Check the current CSLB record ↗</a><p>For repairs, installations, water heaters, drainage, and construction, explore our <a href="/services/">service list</a>.</p>','light')+discounts()+end());
